# P6 (2026-10-05): keep dev junk out of the image build context
# P1-fix (a42): `_*` also matched `__init__.py`, so Docker builds dropped
# every package __init__ and `pip install .` inside the image produced a
# broken memtether. Git uses `_[!_]*` for the same reason — mirror it here.
_[!_]*.py
_dev/
dev/
build/
dist/
tests/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.lock
models/
hf_space/
.git/
.claude-plugin/
.pytest_cache/
bench_data/
